        }
      ],
      "title": "乐园秘宝·Ⅲ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "24440001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "朋克小子",
          "text": "哼，再让我找到那个牙膏，我一定揍得他满地找牙！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24440002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仙人掌",
          "text": "大哥，它好像没有那种东西……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24440003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "朋克小子",
          "text": "哎呀，不说这些了，还是宝藏要紧！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24440004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "朋克小子",
          "text": "街球假面，你靠那么前干嘛，宝藏是我们的！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24440005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仙人掌",
          "text": "就是，再往前挤小心我扎你！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24440006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克里斯",
          "text": "凭你们两个劣等手办也想防我？看我花式过人！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24440007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仙人掌",
          "text": "可恶！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24440008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "白井黑子",
          "text": "好多手办……简直像是有人故意把大家吸引过来一样。\n不过这个陷阱明明那么拙劣，竟然能骗到这么多手办。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24440009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "御坂美琴",
          "text": "……也许对于流浪手办而言，如果能重获主人的爱，即使只有微乎其微的可能性，也值得冒险一试吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24440010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "白井黑子",
          "text": "居然利用人性的弱点，设计宝藏的人实在太可恶了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24440011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "御坂美琴",
          "text": "确实可恶！不过现在还不知道对方把手办们聚集到这里，到底有什么用意，先静观其变吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24440012",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "……",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24440013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "源上",
          "text": "宝藏，归我了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24440014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克里斯",
          "text": "你以为你能带着平安离开这里吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24440015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仙人掌",
          "text": "戴斗笠的，把药水平分给我们，我们护你出去！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24440016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "源上",
          "text": "不需要。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24440017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克里斯",
          "text": "别跟他啰嗦，所有人跟着我从左右两面包夹他！上！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24440018",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "众手办",
          "text": "上！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24440019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "hiahiahia，看起来是时候收网了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24440020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "御坂美琴",
          "text": "……是谁？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24440021",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "text": "砰！！！",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24440022",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "御坂美琴",
          "text": "（糟糕，涂料盒里是催眠瓦斯……）",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-605",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "bundle": "paojie1",
